From 33ea5dfac0de3be6da8f9a64058ae153b7ba7e5b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 21:50:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Security phase 1: H-01..H-05, H-09 (branch, not deployed)

- H-01 migration: trigger + WITH CHECK so users cannot edit plan/trial/stripe/cloud columns of their own profile
- H-02 add moneynest.es to CORS allowlists (delete-account, create-checkout, create-portal-session, restore-access); portal return_url only to allowed origins
- H-03 send-email: no open relay (recipient = session email, otp removed, escaped HTML, DB rate limit); client sends session token
- H-04 stripe-webhook: only processed=true events are duplicates; log via upsert
- H-05 delete-account: cancel all live subs first, abort (502) on real Stripe failure, paginate
- H-09 restore-access: require verified email
- tests under supabase/tests

