- H-07 consent banner (accept/reject equivalent); no analytics id/events without consent; errors anonymous without consent
- H-08 self-host Google Fonts, Chart.js, jsPDF, autotable, xlsx, supabase-js (vendor/); CSP without jsDelivr/cdnjs/Google Fonts
